BRAND ASSETS
------------

This section is the licensor's statement of what is being made available. It
carves the brand assets out of the Apache License 2.0 that otherwise covers
this repository (see LICENSE) — the Apache text below the carve-out in
`LICENSE` is unmodified; this is the separate, narrower statement about these
files specifically.

The brand assets are the Fernscout wordmark, the waymark logo and the icons
drawn from it. In this repository they are:

    docs/branding/fernscout-logo.svg
    docs/branding/fernscout-logo-inverse.svg
    docs/branding/fernscout-logo-mono.svg
    docs/branding/fernscout-wordmark.svg
