    ios/App/App/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset
    ios/App/App/Assets.xcassets/Splash.imageset
    ios/App/ShareInbox/Assets.xcassets/Mark.imageset

and the copies of the waymark's paths written inline, verbatim, in
app/apple-icon.tsx and app/opengraph-image.tsx.

They are part of the software and they ship with it, because an instance has
to be able to draw itself. Run Fernscout for yourself, modify it,
redistribute it: the assets come along, and that is intended.

